    "url": "https://www.yilore.app/en/terms",
    "title": "Support Center",
    "images": [
      "/mountain.svg",
      "/app_icon.jpg"
    ],
    "content": "HelpSupport CenterWe are always here to help and support you.\nYilorePerfect combination of traditional wisdom and modern technology, providing you with a unique divination experience.\nDownload on App StoreFrequently Asked QuestionsHow to use Yilore for divination?After opening the app, you can:\nEnter the question you want to consult in the question input interface\nChoose divination method (I Ching or Tarot)\nFollow the app guidance to complete the divination process\nView the AI intelligent interpretation results and suggestions\nAre the divination results accurate?Yilore combines traditional I Ching wisdom with modern AI technology to provide you with inspiring guidance. Divination results are for reference only, and final decisions should still be made based on your actual situation. We recommend approaching divination results with an open mind, using them as another perspective for thinking about issues.\nDoes the app require internet connection?Yes, Yilore requires internet connection to provide AI intelligent interpretation services. We recommend using it in a WiFi environment for the best experience. Some basic features may support offline use, but the complete divination experience requires internet connection.\nHow is my privacy protected?We take your privacy protection very seriously. Your divination questions and results are encrypted, and we do not share your personal information with third parties. For details, please see our Privacy Policy.\nWhat to do if the app crashes?If the app crashes or behaves abnormally, please try the following solutions:\nRestart the app\nCheck your internet connection\nUpdate to the latest version\nRestart your device\nIf the problem persists, contact our technical support\nHow to provide feedback or suggestions?We welcome your feedback! You can contact us through the following methods:\nSend email to postmaster@lichen.xin\nContact UsFor questions or requests, please email:\npostmaster@lichen.xinCompany InformationCompany Name: Lichen Technology (Shanghai) Co., Ltd.\nWebsite: www.yilore.app\n© 2026 Lichen Technology (Shanghai) Co., Ltd. All rights reserved.\nGet the Yilore appFull charts, daily hexagrams, and deeper AI readings on your phone.\nApp Store"
