    "fullTitleEn": "Hexagram 3 — Difficulty at the Beginning: Water over Thunder — The Sprouting Seed's Struggle Through Chaos",
    "fullTitleZh": "水雷屯卦詳解：萬事開頭難、卦象爻辭與現代運勢全解析 | 易經第三卦",
    "subtitleEn": "Hexagram 3 — Difficulty at the Beginning is the third of the 64 hexagrams of the I Ching. Water over Thunder symbolizes the chaos of birth — immense potential struggling through initial hardship. Full analysis of the Judgment, Image, and all six lines.",
    "subtitleZh": "易經第三卦水雷屯詳解。屯卦象徵“初生之難”，代表事物在萌芽階段的艱難險阻與無限生機。全面解析屯卦卦辭、六爻含義，以及在事業起步、感情複合與財運占卜中的實際指導建議。",
    "cardTitleEn": "The Tender Shoot Breaks Through Hard Soil",
    "cardTitleZh": "易羅解讀",
    "guaCiEn": "Difficulty at the Beginning: Sublime success. Perseverance furthers. Nothing should be undertaken. It furthers one to appoint helpers.",
    "guaCiZh": "屯：元亨，利貞，勿用有攸往，利建侯。",
    "imageCommentaryEn": "Clouds and thunder: the image of Difficulty at the Beginning. Thus the superior person brings order out of confusion.",
    "imageCommentaryZh": "雲雷屯，君子以經綸。",
    "overviewEn": "Hexagram 3 — Difficulty at the Beginning (☵☳) is the third of the 64 hexagrams of the I Ching. The upper trigram is Kan (Water, representing danger and the abysmal), while the lower trigram is Zhen (Thunder, representing movement and initiative). Thunder rumbles beneath the clouds; a great rain is about to fall but has not yet arrived — this is the primordial chaos where heaven and earth have just united, all things are about to sprout, yet the seedling is still pressed down by heavy soil.\nThe character \"Zhun\" (屯) itself carries the image of a young sprout struggling to break through the earth — the difficulty of first birth. The Judgment, \"Sublime success. Perseverance furthers,\" affirms the immense vitality and potential for success hidden within this moment. But the words that follow — \"Nothing should be undertaken. It furthers one to appoint helpers\" — provide the essential strategy: in the beginning stages of any venture, one must not rush forward blindly or go it alone. The wisest course is to take root where you stand, build alliances, assemble a reliable team (appoint helpers), and wait for the right moment. The Image Commentary's counsel — \"the superior person brings order out of confusion\" — reminds us to untangle the threads of chaos like sorting tangled silk, laying out a clear blueprint for the future.",
    "overviewZh": "屯（zhūn）卦，為《易經》六十四卦之第三卦。從卦象上看，上卦為坎代表雲、代表險難；下卦為震代表雷、代表動力。雷在雲下轟鳴，大雨將至未至，這正是天地交合、萬物即將萌發卻又被厚土所壓制的混沌狀態。\n“屯”字本身就有草木初生、艱難破土之意。卦辭“元亨，利貞”肯定了它蘊含著巨大的生機與亨通的潛力，但緊接著的“勿用有攸往，利建侯”則給出了具體的行動綱領：在事業或事物的初創期，切不可盲目冒進、單打獨鬥；最聰明的做法是原地紮根，廣結善緣，建立起堅實的團隊和陣地（建侯），靜待時機。大象傳的“君子以經綸”，更是提醒我們要像整理亂絲一樣，在千頭萬緒的開端中理清脈絡，規劃好未來的藍圖。",
    "readingSectionsEn": [],
    "readingSectionsZh": [],
    "divinationEn": {
      "career": "You are in the startup phase or early transition of your career, facing enormous resistance and uncertainty. You may feel overwhelmed, directionless, or hitting walls at every turn. Your core objective right now is not to chase profits or achievements, but to survive and build a solid foundation. Focus on understanding the deep logic of your industry, assembling your network and team, and avoiding reckless solo charges. Seek out mentors and experienced allies — in times of difficulty, building a strong organizational structure and support network is the key to weathering the storm.",
      "love": "Whether you are pursuing someone new or navigating the early friction of a relationship, this period will be full of setbacks, misunderstandings, and resistance from external circumstances. If single, do not rush to confess your feelings — it is likely to be rejected. If in a relationship, communication gaps may create distance between you. True love must withstand the test of time. Use patience, sincerity, and wisdom to slowly melt the ice before you.",
      "wealth": "Your financial situation may be tight, or a new investment is in its infancy — still in the phase of constant input with little visible return. Do not rush to recoup your investment through high-risk speculation or reckless expansion. Direct your funds to where they matter most, build core competitive advantages, and advance steadily. Wait for the market timing to mature. In the startup phase, going all-in is the greatest taboo — a prudent financial strategy will carry you further.",
      "health": "Because your life or career is in a pioneering phase, the psychological pressure and physical toll are extremely heavy. This can easily trigger nervous anxiety, insomnia, or stagnant liver qi and other sub-health issues. Pay special attention to balancing work and rest — do not push through by sheer willpower alone. Maintain a calm mindset in the face of initial chaos. Protecting your body — your fundamental capital — is the true foundation of any endeavor."
    },
    "divinationZh": {
      "career": "此時正處於事業的起步期或轉型初期，面臨的阻力和不確定性非常大。你可能會感到手忙腳亂、缺乏方向，甚至處處碰壁。現在的核心目標不是去贏取多大的利潤或成就，而是要在現有的崗位或專案中“活下來”，打好基礎。建議多結交行業前輩，搭建自己的人脈和團隊網路，避免一個人盲目衝撞。",
      "love": "無論是追求心儀的物件，還是處於磨合期的戀愛關係，這段時期都會充滿波折、誤會或來自外界現實條件的阻力。如果是單身，不要急於表白，容易遭到拒絕；如果正在交往，雙方容易因為溝通不暢產生隔閡。真正的感情需要經得起時間的考驗，用耐心、真誠和理智去融化眼前的堅冰。",
      "wealth": "目前的財務狀況可能比較緊張，或者你投資的新專案剛剛起步，正處於不斷投入、短期內難以看到豐厚回報的階段。千萬不要因為著急回本而進行高風險的投機，或者盲目擴大規模。此時應該把資金用在刀刃上，建立核心競爭力，穩紮穩打，靜待市場時機的成熟。",
      "health": "由於生活或事業處於開拓期，你承受的心理壓力和體力消耗都非常大，容易引起神經系統焦慮、失眠或肝氣鬱結等亞健康問題。需要特別注意勞逸結合，不要硬扛。保持平和的心態來面對初期的混亂，保護好身體的“本錢”才是革命的基礎。"
    },
