        "positionLabelEn": "Six in the Second",
        "positionLabelZh": "六二",
        "titleEn": "Difficulties pile up. Horses and wagon part. Not a robber but a wooer. The maiden is chaste and does not pledge herself. Ten years — then she pledges herself.",
        "titleZh": "屯如邅如，乘馬班如。匪寇婚媾，女子貞不字，十年乃字。",
        "yaoTextEn": "Six in the Second: Difficulties pile up. Horses and wagon part. He is not a robber; he wants to woo. The maiden is chaste; she does not pledge herself. Ten years — then she pledges herself.",
        "yaoTextZh": "六二：屯如，邅如，乘馬班如，匪寇，婚媾。女子貞不字，十年乃字。",
        "summaryEn": "Progress is blocked at every turn, creating agonizing indecision. Someone appears who seems like a threat but is actually seeking alliance. Yet the time is not ripe, and one cannot see the other's true nature clearly — one must remain steadfast and refuse prematurely. Only after a long period of testing (ten years) can true acceptance come.",
        "summaryZh": "前行艱難，進退兩難。此時有人看似像強盜般突然闖入，實則是來求合作或求婚的。但因為時機尚未成熟，或者你還看不清對方的底細，必須保持貞定，予以拒絕。需要經過漫長的時間考驗（十年），確認安全後才能真正接納。",
        "tuanEn": "The Tuan Commentary says: Difficulty at the Beginning — the firm and the yielding begin to interact, and difficulty is born. Movement amid danger leads to sublime success through perseverance. The movement of thunder and rain fills all things to overflowing. Heaven creates the primal chaos — it is fitting to appoint helpers, yet there shall be no rest.",
        "tuanZh": "彖曰：屯，剛柔始交而難生，動乎險中，大亨貞。雷雨之動滿盈，天造草昧，宜建侯而不寧。屯卦象徵剛柔初交、萬物始生之際的艱難，在險難中行動，但終將大為亨通。雷雨交加、天地草創之時，宜建立統治秩序，不可安逸懈怠。",
        "imageEn": "",
        "imageZh": "",
        "divinationEn": {
          "Career": "Six in the Second points to a painful period of stagnation in your career. You may be experiencing a frustrating standstill — projects stalling, promotions seeming impossibly distant, or job-switching opportunities that don't feel reliable. Someone may have extended an olive branch (a collaboration offer, a recruiter's call, a new project opportunity), but you cannot determine whether these are trustworthy. Do not reject everything outright, but do not accept blindly either. Conduct thorough research, consult trusted mentors, and give yourself a reasonable evaluation period. Meanwhile, continue building your skills in your current role — do not slack off while waiting.",
          "Relationships": "In love, Six in the Second depicts a state of painful push-and-pull. Someone may be pursuing you or showing interest, but past emotional wounds or uncertainties about the other person keep your guard firmly up. \"Not a robber but a wooer\" reminds you: this person may genuinely have good intentions and is not coming to hurt you. Caution is appropriate, but don't let self-protection become self-isolation. Give yourself and others a chance to rebuild trust. Take it slowly — \"ten years — then she pledges\" means good things take time to mature, but they will eventually bloom.",
          "Wealth": "Financially, Six in the Second suggests you are in a state of \"opportunity present but afraid to seize it.\" An investment opportunity or profitable partnership may be on the table, but you doubt its authenticity and reliability. This caution is not wrong — in the environment of Hexagram 3, extra vigilance is warranted. Do three things: first, conduct comprehensive due diligence on the opportunity; second, set a maximum acceptable loss threshold; third, if you decide to participate, start with a small amount to test viability before gradually increasing your stake. Don't miss every opportunity through indecision, but don't go all-in on impulse either.",
          "Health": "Health-wise, Six in the Second warns about the toll of prolonged anxiety and mental tension. The constant push-and-pull, the repeated inner struggle, severely drains your mental energy and may lead to insomnia, headaches, digestive problems, and other symptoms. Find an effective way to decompress — meditation, walks, confiding in a good friend, or journaling to organize your thoughts. Don't neglect basic self-care, especially when under intense mental stress. Like the old fisherman on the cold river — though the wait is long, one must still keep warm and conserve strength."
        },
        "divinationZh": {
          "事業運勢": "六二爻在事業方面指向「僵持與等待」。你可能正在經歷一段令人煎熬的停滯期——專案推進不順、晉升遙遙無期、或者跳槽機會看起來不太靠譜。此時可能有人向你伸出了橄欖枝（合作邀請、獵頭電話、新的專案機會），但你無法確定這些機會是否值得信賴。建議你不要一味拒絕，但也不要貿然接受——做充分的調查和評估，找你信任的前輩請教，給自己設定一個合理的考察期。同時在當前崗位上繼續積累，不要因為等待而鬆懈。",
          "感情運勢": "感情方面，六二爻描繪了一段「欲拒還迎」的糾結狀態。你可能正被某個人追求，或者有人對你釋放好感訊號，但你因為過去的感情創傷或對方的某些不確定因素，始終無法放下戒備。「匪寇，婚媾」提醒你：對方可能真的是帶著誠意來的，不是來傷害你的。當然，謹慎是應該的，但不要把自我保護變成了自我封閉。給自己一個重新信任的機會，慢慢來，不用著急——「十年乃字」說的就是好事需要時間沉澱，但最終會開花結果。",
          "財運分析": "財運方面，六二爻暗示你處於「有機會但不敢抓」的猶豫狀態。可能有一個投資機會或賺錢的合作方案擺在面前，但你對其真實性和可靠性持懷疑態度。這種謹慎本身沒有錯——在屯卦的環境下，確實需要格外小心。建議你做好三件事：第一，對機會進行全面的盡職調查；第二，設定可承受的最大損失額度；第三，如果決定參與，先以小資金試水，驗證可行性後再逐步加碼。不要因為猶豫而錯過所有機會，也不要因為衝動而全部壓上。",
          "健康提示": "健康方面，六二爻提醒你注意長期焦慮和精神緊張帶來的身心影響。持續的進退兩難、反覆的內心掙扎會嚴重消耗你的精神能量，可能導致失眠、頭痛、消化不良等症狀。建議你找到一種有效的減壓方式——冥想、散步、與好友傾訴、或者寫日記梳理思緒。同時不要忘記基本的身體保養，特別是在精神高度緊張時更要注意飲食和休息。就像寒江獨釣的老人，雖然等待漫長，但也要注意保暖和體力儲備。"
        },
