    "divinationEn": {
      "career": "Overall advice: For career questions, this hexagram does not favor rushing forward. Practice 'decisive action and the nurturing of virtue' — take action, but focus even more on building foundational capabilities. The accumulation of this stage is the foundation for future flight.",
      "love": "Overall assessment: Hexagram 4 in relationships does not suggest rapid development; it favors a slow, steady flow of mutual learning and growth. A relationship where two people are both teacher and friend, progressing together — that is the most beautiful form of love under Hexagram 4.",
      "wealth": "Overall advice: Hexagram 4's financial guidance favors defense over offense, learning over gambling. Transform your current 'ignorance' into motivation for learning, cultivate deeply in one field, and financial fortune will naturally arrive as your capabilities mature.",
      "health": "Practical advice: Establish good health habits (the health version of 'decisive action and nurturing virtue') — regular sleep schedules, adequate rest, balanced nutrition. If you have lingering subtle discomforts (fatigue, digestive issues, sleep disturbances), now is an excellent time for proactive intervention. Do not wait until you are 'trapped in ignorance' before seeking medical help."
    },
    "divinationZh": {
      "career": "整體建議：此卦問事業，不宜急進，宜「果行育德」——有所行動，但更要培育底層能力。此階段的積累，是未來騰飛的基礎。",
      "love": "整體判斷：蒙卦感情非急速發展之象，更適合細水長流、相互學習成長的關係。兩人如師如友，共同進步，才是蒙卦感情最美好的形態。",
      "wealth": "整體建議：蒙卦財運宜守不宜攻，宜學不宜賭。把當下的「矇昧」轉化為學習動力，深耕一個領域，財運自然隨能力的成熟而到來。",
      "health": "實用建議：建立良好的健康習慣（「果行育德」的健康版），例如規律作息、充足睡眠、合理飲食；如有長期隱性不適（疲勞、消化問題、睡眠障礙等），此時是主動干預的好時機，不要拖到「困蒙」才尋醫。"
    },
