        "summaryZh": "出師必立嚴明紀律，無規矩則成烏合之眾，律法是一切行動的根基。",
        "tuanEn": "The Tuan Commentary says: The Army means the masses. Perseverance means correctness. He who can lead the masses with correctness may be king. The strong line gains the center and is responded to; going forth in the midst of danger and acting obediently — with this one may poison all under heaven, and the people follow. Good fortune — what blame could there be?",
        "tuanZh": "彖曰：師，眾也，貞，正也，能以眾正，可以王矣。剛中而應，行險而順，以此毒天下，而民從之，吉又何咎矣。",
