    "subtitleEn": "I Ching Hexagram 8 Holding Together (Union) (Bi) explained. Symbolizing unity, alliance, and mutual support. Full analysis of the judgment, six lines, and guidance for relationships, career alliances, and building community.",
    "subtitleZh": "易經第八卦水地比詳解。比卦象徵水附於地，代表親密、合作與和睦。全面解析比卦卦辭“不寧方來，後夫兇”、六爻含義，以及在團隊建設、人際交往、感情升溫與事業合作中的占卜指導。",
    "cardTitleEn": "Yilore Reading",
