        "yaoTextZh": "初六：有孚比之，無咎。有孚盈缶，終來有它，吉",
        "summaryEn": "Begin your alliances with complete sincerity, like a simple vessel filled to the brim with trust. When your heart is genuine, others will naturally be drawn to you, and unexpected blessings will follow.",
        "summaryZh": "帶著滿滿的誠意去與人結交，就像把酒罈子（缶）裝得滿滿的一樣毫不保留，這樣自然沒有災禍。別人感受到你的真誠，最終也會帶著意想不到的好運或回報（有它）來找你。誠意是建立一切關係的基石。",
        "tuanEn": "The Tuan Commentary says: Holding Together brings good fortune. Holding Together means support. The yielding cleaves to the strong. \"Consult the oracle once again whether you possess sublimity, constancy, and perseverance\" — then there is no blame, for in this way the unsettled come. \"One who is late in coming meets misfortune\" — the way has been exhausted.",
