        "titleEn": "No Relationship With What Is Harmful — Remain Blameless",
        "titleZh": "無交害，匪咎，艱則無咎。",
        "yaoTextEn": "First Nine: No relationship with what is harmful; there is no blame in this. If one remains conscious of difficulty, one remains without blame.",
        "yaoTextZh": "初九：無交害，匪咎，艱則無咎",
        "summaryEn": "In the beginning of great possession, keep clear of harmful associations. As long as you avoid entanglements with negative influences and remain conscious of difficulty, there will be no blame.",
        "summaryZh": "在財富增長的初期，不與驕奢淫逸之風同流合汙，就不會有傷害。雖然這不是什麼過錯，但必須保持艱苦奮鬥的憂患意識。只有這樣，在面對誘惑時才不會犯錯。",
        "tuanEn": "The Tuan says: In Possession in Great Measure the soft obtains the honored position, the great center, and the upper and lower respond to it. This is called Possession in Great Measure. Its virtues are firmness and strength, elegance and brightness. It corresponds to heaven and acts in accordance with the time. This is why there is sublime success.",
        "tuanZh": "彖曰：大有，柔得尊位大中，而上下應之，曰大有。其德剛健而文明，應乎天而時行，是以元亨。",
