    "subtitleEn": "I Ching Hexagram 15 Modesty (Qian) explained. A mountain hidden within the earth — the greatest power concealed in humility. Analysis of judgment, six lines, and guidance for achieving lasting success through genuine modesty.",
    "subtitleZh": "易經第十五卦地山謙詳解。謙卦象徵高山處於大地之下，代表謙遜、均衡與深藏不露。全面解析謙卦卦辭“君子有終”、六爻含義，以及在事業晉升、人際社交、感情經營與財富守護中的大吉指導。",
