        "answer": "Because modesty is the one quality that improves every situation without exception. Strength can be excessive, brilliance can be blinding, ambition can be destructive — but genuine humility always helps and never harms. The I Ching recognizes this by making Modesty its most universally positive hexagram. In any position, at any stage, in any context, genuine humility leads to good outcomes."
