    "fullTitleEn": "Hexagram 17 Following Explained: Adaptability, Joyful Allegiance & the Wisdom of Yielding | I Ching",
    "fullTitleZh": "澤雷隨卦詳解：順應時勢、隨緣而動與現代運勢全解析 | 易經第十七卦",
    "subtitleEn": "I Ching Hexagram 17 Following (Sui) explained. Thunder rests within the lake — adapting joyfully to the times. Analysis of judgment, six lines, and guidance for choosing whom to follow and when to lead.",
    "subtitleZh": "易經第十七卦澤雷隨詳解。隨卦象徵澤中有雷、隨和順應，代表跟隨、擇善而從與隨時調整。全面解析隨卦卦辭“元亨利貞，無咎”、六爻含義，以及在事業跟進、感情順從與人際交往中的實際占卜指導。",
    "cardTitleEn": "Yilore Reading",
    "cardTitleZh": "易羅解讀",
    "guaCiEn": "Following has sublime success. Perseverance furthers. No blame.",
    "guaCiZh": "隨：元亨利貞，無咎。",
    "imageCommentaryEn": "Thunder in the middle of the lake: the image of Following. Thus the superior person at nightfall goes indoors for rest and recuperation.",
    "imageCommentaryZh": "澤中有雷，隨。君子以嚮晦入宴息。",
    "overviewEn": "Following (Sui) is the seventeenth hexagram. The lower trigram is Zhen (Thunder/Movement) and the upper is Dui (Lake/Joy). Thunder, which normally rises, here rests beneath the lake — the strong voluntarily places itself below the gentle. This represents the wisdom of knowing when to lead and when to follow.\nThe judgment promises 'sublime success' for Following — because adapting to the times with joy and integrity is one of life's most powerful skills. The Image advises rest at nightfall: even the most energetic must know when to stop and follow the natural rhythm. True following is not servility but wisdom — knowing which currents to ride, which leaders to support, and when to rest.",
    "overviewZh": "隨卦是易經六十四卦之第十七卦。上卦為兌代表澤，下卦為震代表雷。澤中有雷，象徵著能量在包容的環境中順勢而動。隨卦的核心在於隨和與順應，象徵著外部環境在發生劇烈變化，而你需要做出順應。大象傳提到嚮晦入宴息，教導我們要順應天時，該行動時行動，該休息時休息。這是一種與時俱進、擇善而從的生存智慧。",
    "readingSectionsEn": [
      {
        "heading": "The Wisdom of Willing Alignment",
        "body": "The sunflower doesn't debate whether to face the sun — it turns naturally toward what nourishes it. This is the essence of wise Following: aligning yourself with what genuinely serves your growth. Not blind obedience, but intelligent, joyful orientation toward what is truly good."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Knowing What to Follow",
        "body": "The card's deeper teaching is about discernment. The sunflower follows the sun, not any random light. Similarly, your following must be directed at what is truly worthy — leaders of genuine integrity, paths of authentic growth, rhythms that nourish rather than deplete. The quality of what you follow determines the quality of your life."
      }
    ],
    "readingSectionsZh": [],
    "divinationEn": {
      "career": "In career, Following advises aligning yourself with the right leaders, mentors, or movements. This is not the time for solo ventures but for joining forces with those whose vision you genuinely support. Be a great follower now — your time to lead will come.",
      "love": "In love, Following speaks to the beauty of mutual adaptation. Sometimes you lead, sometimes you follow — the key is doing both with joy and without ego. If seeking a partner, look for someone whose direction you can genuinely and happily support.",
      "wealth": "Financially, follow proven strategies and trusted advisors rather than striking out on your own. Align your investments with established trends and sound counsel. This is a time for following the market's wisdom, not fighting it.",
      "health": "Health-wise, follow your body's natural rhythms. Rest when tired, eat when hungry, move when energized. The hexagram's Image — resting at nightfall — is literally good health advice: align your habits with natural cycles."
    },
    "divinationZh": {
      "career": "在事業上，現在不宜強行主導或固執己見。你應該仔細觀察形勢，靈活應對變化。這是一個利於跟進專案、執行決策的時期。多聽取他人的建議，尋找一位德才兼備的領導者或合作伙伴進行追隨。這種動態的、有原則的跟隨，會讓你比盲目開拓更省力且更有成就。",
      "love": "感情運勢非常平穩和諧。隨卦代表一種夫唱婦隨的默契。在關係中，學會放下控制慾，多順從對方的合理需求，會讓雙方的關係更加親密。單身者近期適合透過朋友介紹或在社交活動中展現隨和的一面，你這種不帶攻擊性的性格會非常吸引異性的關注。",
      "wealth": "財運平順，但不是大發橫財的時期。理財策略應順應大盤趨勢或聽取專業人士的意見。適合跟進一些已經成熟、有口碑的穩健專案。不要輕易嘗試逆勢操作，在這個階段，借力打力和隨大勢而動能保住你的本金並獲得穩步增值。",
      "health": "健康方面需遵循嚮晦入宴息的道理，起居有常。近期需注意消化系統和脾胃的保養，飲食宜清淡、規律。同時，良好的睡眠是你恢復能量的關鍵。不要過度熬夜，讓身體的生物鐘順應自然的晝夜交替，這是隨卦給你的健康養生指南。"
    },
    "frontUrlEn": "/yilore-cards/en/17a-en.webp",
    "backUrlEn": "/yilore-cards/en/17b-en.webp",
    "frontUrlZh": "/yilore-cards/hant/17a.webp",
