        "position": 3,
        "positionLabelEn": "Six in the Third",
        "positionLabelZh": "六三",
        "titleEn": "Clinging to the Strong Man, Losing the Small Boy",
        "titleZh": "系丈夫，失小子。隨有求得，利居貞。",
        "yaoTextEn": "Six in the Third: If one clings to the strong man, one loses the small boy. Through following one finds what one seeks. It furthers one to remain persevering.",
        "yaoTextZh": "六三：系丈夫，失小子。隨有求得，利居貞",
        "summaryEn": "The reverse of the Second line: by following what is great and worthy, you necessarily leave behind what is small and limiting. Following a worthy path requires letting go of lesser attachments. Perseverance and clarity of purpose further.",
        "summaryZh": "選擇了追隨有德、有能力的丈夫（強者），捨棄了卑微的小利。這種追隨是有所得的，但必須堅守本心，保持正直的立場才會有利。",
        "tuanEn": "The Tuan says: In Following, the strong comes and places itself under the weak. Movement and joy: Following. Great success, correctness, and no blame — the world follows the time.",
