    "fullTitleEn": "Hexagram 18 Work on What Has Been Spoiled: Repairing Decay, Restoring Order & Renewal | I Ching",
    "fullTitleZh": "蠱卦詳解：山風蠱卦辭爻辭全解讀，整頓積弊與革新重生之道｜易經第十八卦",
    "subtitleEn": "I Ching Hexagram 18 Work on What Has Been Spoiled (Gu) explained. Wind stirs beneath the mountain, symbolizing the need to repair decay and corruption. Full analysis of judgment, lines, and practical guidance.",
    "subtitleZh": "蠱卦為易經第十八卦，山風蠱，上艮下巽，象徵積弊已久、亟待整頓革新。本文深度解析蠱卦卦辭\"元亨利涉大川先甲三日後甲三日\"、大象傳\"振民育德\"，以及六爻幹父之蠱、裕父之蠱、不事王侯等完整含義，結合事業、感情、財運、健康給出實用占卜參考。",
    "cardTitleEn": "Yilore Reading",
    "cardTitleZh": "易羅解讀",
    "guaCiEn": "Work on What Has Been Spoiled has sublime success. It furthers one to cross the great water. Before the starting point, three days. After the starting point, three days.",
    "guaCiZh": "元亨，利涉大川。先甲三日，後甲三日。",
    "imageCommentaryEn": "The wind blows low on the mountain: the image of Decay. Thus the superior person stirs up the people and strengthens their spirit.",
    "imageCommentaryZh": "山下有風，蠱。君子以振民育德。",
    "overviewEn": "Work on What Has Been Spoiled (Gu) is the eighteenth hexagram. The lower trigram is Xun (Wind/Gentle) and the upper is Gen (Mountain/Keeping Still). Wind blowing at the mountain's base — stagnant conditions that have allowed decay to accumulate. The character 蛊 itself depicts worms in a vessel: corruption that breeds when things are left unattended.\nThe judgment promises 'sublime success' for this work — repairing what has been spoiled is one of the noblest undertakings. 'Before the starting point, three days; after the starting point, three days' counsels careful preparation before acting and careful follow-up afterward. The work of restoration requires patience, planning, and persistence. The Image tells the superior person to 'stir up the people and strengthen their spirit' — because the most important repair is always to the human heart.",
    "overviewZh": "蠱卦（☶☴）是《周易》第十八卦，上卦為艮（山），下卦為巽（風）。山在上，風在下——風遇山而受阻，無法流通，久而久之，氣息停滯，蟲蠹叢生。這正是蠱卦最深刻的自然意象：停滯導致腐敗，腐敗呼喚整治。\n「蠱」字本義是器皿中滋生的毒蟲，引申為積弊、腐敗、混亂之事。但「蠱」還有另一層含義——「事也，飭也」，即整頓、治理之事。蠱卦雖以腐敗為象，卻以整治為道：弊病的出現，正是革新的契機；積垢越深，掃除之後生機越盛。\n陽光穿透塵埃，荒廢的院落中積滿灰塵、落葉與蛛網，一個男子揮掃著竹掃帚專心清掃——這正是蠱卦的畫面：直面積弊，以行動除垢，帶來新的生機。\n卦辭：元亨，利涉大川。先甲三日，後甲三日\n蠱卦卦辭看似矛盾——腐敗之卦卻說「元亨」？關鍵就在這裡：\n元亨：事物壞到極處，必然走向整治；整治成功，則大為亨通。「蠱元亨，而天下治也」——正因為敢於面對並整治積弊，才能讓天下重歸治平。弊病是危機，更是轉機。\n利涉大川：整治積弊需要勇氣與行動，「往有事也」——去做那件必須做的事，果敢涉險，才能成就大業。\n先甲三日，後甲三日：「甲」是天干之首，代表新的開始。「先甲三日」意味著在新開始之前三天要做好充分的準備、清除舊弊（辛日，辛同新，改過自新）；「後甲三日」意味著新開始之後三天要做好鞏固、叮嚀防範（丁日，丁寧叮囑）。這是整治積弊最完整的時間智慧：除舊要徹底，布新要穩固，「終則有始，天行也」——終結舊的，才能開始新的，這是天道的執行規律。\n彖傳：蠱，剛上而柔下，巽而止，蠱\n《彖傳》揭示了蠱卦的結構邏輯：剛健在上（艮），柔順在下（巽）——在下者只知順從，在上者止而不進，上下皆失其正位，於是積弊由此而生。「巽而止」——柔順加上停滯，正是腐敗的溫床。\n但《彖傳》隨即指出：「蠱元亨，而天下治也。」腐敗的出現，恰恰揭示了問題所在，也為治理提供了方向。敢於「幹蠱」（整治積弊）者，方能致元亨、使天下治。\n大象傳：山下有風，蠱。君子以振民育德\n山下之風不能流通，萬物因而腐化。君子觀此卦象，領悟到兩大使命：「振民」——振作民心，激勵眾人從萎靡中奮起；「育德」——培育德行，從根本上消除滋生腐敗的土壤。振民是治標，育德是治本。兩者缺一不可，方能從根本上祛除積弊，實現長治久安。",
    "readingSectionsEn": [
      {
        "heading": "The Nobility of Repair",
        "body": "This card elevates repair work to its proper status: one of the most noble and valuable activities possible. While others seek glory in creating the new, the person depicted here finds deep meaning in restoring what has been neglected. Cleaning away corruption, repairing broken systems, healing old wounds — this work transforms decay into renewal."
      },
      {
        "heading": "The Three Days Before and After",
        "body": "The card's wisdom includes the hexagram's advice about timing: prepare carefully before starting (three days before) and follow up diligently after acting (three days after). Hasty repairs often make things worse. Patient, thoughtful restoration creates lasting renewal."
      }
    ],
    "readingSectionsZh": [],
    "divinationEn": {
      "career": "In career, something has gone wrong through neglect or mismanagement — perhaps inherited problems, accumulated dysfunction, or slowly degraded standards. This is not a time for blame but for repair. Roll up your sleeves and address the root causes. The work is difficult but deeply rewarding.",
      "love": "In relationships, old wounds, accumulated resentments, or neglected issues need attention. The hexagram calls for honest confrontation of what has been spoiled — not to assign blame but to heal and renew. Careful, patient work on the relationship's foundations brings sublime success.",
      "wealth": "Financially, address problems that have been accumulating — debts, disorganized accounts, bad investments held too long, or financial habits that have slowly deteriorated. Clean up your financial house with the same care you would bring to repairing a treasured heirloom.",
      "health": "Health issues that have developed through neglect need attention now. Address chronic conditions, change harmful habits, and repair the damage of years of inattention. The hexagram promises that even long-standing health problems can improve with dedicated, patient effort."
    },
    "divinationZh": {
      "career": "整體建議：蠱卦問事業需要魄力與智慧並用。魄力在於敢於「幹蠱」，智慧在於「得中道」——以九二的中道處理複雜的人際關係，以六五的德行凝聚人心，以上九的格局功成不居。",
      "love": "整體判斷：蠱卦感情需要勇氣和智慧，但處理之後，往往能迎來感情的新生。「終則有始」，這正是蠱卦給感情最深刻的承諾。",
      "wealth": "整體建議：蠱卦財運不適合當下大規模擴張，而適合整頓現有結構，清除隱患，為下一階段的增長打下堅實基礎。",
      "health": "實用建議：若有長期忽視的健康問題，此時是就醫檢查和開始系統調養的最佳時機；減少久坐不動（山下無風流通之象）；調整飲食結構，清除腸道積滯；同時注意心理的「蠱」——長期壓抑的情緒也是身體積弊的重要來源，要主動疏導。"
    },
