    "guaCiEn": "Approach has sublime success. Perseverance furthers. When the eighth month comes, there will be misfortune.",
    "guaCiZh": "臨：元亨利貞。至於八月有兇。",
    "imageCommentaryEn": "The earth above the lake: the image of Approach. Thus the superior person is inexhaustible in his will to teach, and without limits in his tolerance and protection of the people.",
    "imageCommentaryZh": "澤上有地，臨。君子以教思無窮，容保民無疆。",
    "overviewEn": "Approach (Lin) is the nineteenth hexagram. The lower trigram is Dui (Lake/Joy) and the upper is Kun (Earth/Receptive). Earth approaching the lake from above — the image of authority drawing near, of the great coming to meet the small with care and purpose.\nThe judgment promises 'sublime success' but adds a crucial warning: 'when the eighth month comes, there will be misfortune.' This is the I Ching's reminder that every period of growth carries within it the seeds of decline. The two yang lines at the bottom are growing — but by the eighth month (counting from the hexagram's peak), they will begin to recede. Use this favorable time wisely.",
    "overviewZh": "臨卦是易經六十四卦之第十九卦。從卦象上看，上卦為坤代表地，下卦為兌代表澤。大地高臨湖澤之上，象徵著居高臨下的引領與俯瞰。此時陽氣在下方生長，預示著一股新生的、向上的力量正在蓬勃發展。臨的核心內涵是親臨、來到。卦辭元亨利貞賦予了它全面亨通的定性，但至於八月有兇則在鼎盛之時埋下了一記警鐘，教導我們要隨時保持憂患意識，在好運中佈局未來。大象傳提到君子以教思無窮，提示我們要有長遠的格局和包容的心胸，去教育和感化他人。",
    "readingSectionsEn": [],
    "readingSectionsZh": [],
    "divinationEn": {
      "career": "Career influence is expanding. You are being given more authority, more responsibility, or more access. Use this period to establish yourself firmly and make a lasting positive impact. But plan ahead — the 'eighth month' warning means you should build foundations that will sustain you when conditions change.",
      "love": "In love, Approach indicates growing closeness and deepening connection. Someone or something wonderful is drawing near. Open your heart to receive it. The warmth of genuine, caring attention — like earth sheltering the lake — creates the conditions for lasting love.",
      "wealth": "Financial conditions are improving and influence is growing. Seize opportunities now while conditions favor you. But the 'eighth month' warning applies to wealth too: save during abundance, invest wisely, and prepare for the cycle's turn.",
      "health": "Health is improving, vitality is increasing. Approach this favorable period by establishing strong health foundations — the habits and practices you build now will sustain you through future challenges."
    },
    "divinationZh": {
      "career": "職場運勢非常旺盛。你可能正身處一個領導、管理或教導他人的位置，或者正在被上級委以重任。現在是展示你領導才華、深入基層瞭解實際情況的最好時機。你的決策能得到眾人的擁護。只要能保持耐心，穩紮穩打地推進計劃，事業將進入一個長期的上升通道。",
      "love": "感情關係充滿了積極的能量。目前正處於一個雙方互相吸引、走近彼此的階段。如果你有心儀的物件，現在是主動接觸、表達關懷的絕佳時機。戀愛中的人則會感受到對方更加貼心的關懷，甚至可能有求婚或關係實質性進展的喜訊。用柔和且真誠的態度去對待伴侶，感情將開花結果。",
      "wealth": "財運呈穩定上升趨勢。臨卦預示著新的贏利點或投資機會正在向你招手。你可能會得到專業人士的指點，或者發現一個值得長期投入的賽道。此時不要追求短平快的暴利，而應像大地覆蓋湖澤一樣，做好資產的全面規劃和穩健擴張。隨著你影響力的增加，財富會自然而然地匯聚。",
      "health": "由於陽氣回升，你的身體正處於一個自我修復和活力增強的階段。但正因為事事順遂、忙碌增加，容易出現過度消耗。需注意下半身迴圈系統以及泌尿系統的健康。在積極工作的同時，保持充足的睡眠。臨卦主冬春交替，也要防範感冒等流行性疾病。"
    },
    "frontUrlEn": "/yilore-cards/en/19a-en.webp",
    "backUrlEn": "/yilore-cards/en/19b-en.webp",
