        "titleZh": "甘臨，無攸利。既憂之，無咎。",
        "yaoTextEn": "Six in the Third: Comfortable approach. Nothing that would further. If one is induced to grieve over it, one becomes free of blame.",
        "yaoTextZh": "六三：甘臨，無攸利。既憂之，無咎",
        "summaryEn": "Warning: approaching casually, with too much comfort and not enough seriousness. Sweet words without substance, or familiarity that breeds contempt. If you recognize this and become concerned, the error can be corrected.",
        "summaryZh": "靠甜言蜜語或討好的方式去親近別人。這種缺乏原則的領導方式是沒有好處的。但如果你已經意識到了這種做法的隱患並感到憂慮，及時改正，就不會有災禍。",
        "tuanEn": "The Tuan says: Approach — the strong gradually grows. Joyous and obedient, the strong is in the center and responds. Great success through correctness: this is the way of heaven.",
