        "titleEn": "Complete Approach — No Blame",
        "titleZh": "至臨，無咎。",
        "yaoTextEn": "Six in the Fourth: Complete approach. No blame.",
        "yaoTextZh": "六四：至臨，無咎",
        "summaryEn": "Approaching fully and completely, with total commitment. This is the approach that holds nothing back — full presence, full engagement, full dedication. When you approach completely, there is nothing to blame.",
        "summaryZh": "親自降尊紆貴，來到最前線處理問題。這種行為極其得體且必要，沒有任何災難。這體現了管理者深入基層的務實精神。",
