        "titleZh": "觀國之光，利用賓於王。",
        "yaoTextEn": "Six in the Fourth: Contemplation of the light of the kingdom. It furthers one to exert influence as the guest of a king.",
        "yaoTextZh": "六四：觀國之光，利用賓於王",
        "summaryEn": "Expanding observation to see the broader picture — the nation's culture, the organization's character, the community's spirit. Understanding this 'light' allows you to serve effectively in a larger context.",
        "summaryZh": "觀察國家的文明光輝。代表你已經具備了敏銳的眼光，能夠發現時代的趨勢和優秀的平臺。此時適合去投效有德行的領導者或核心團隊，會受到禮遇。",
