    "subtitleEn": "I Ching Hexagram 22 Grace (Bi) explained. Fire illuminates the mountain — beauty and adornment. Analysis of judgment, lines, and guidance for balancing form and substance in all areas of life.",
    "subtitleZh": "易經第二十二卦山火賁詳解。賁卦象徵山下有火、文明之象，代表文飾、包裝、禮儀與藝術。全面解析賁卦卦辭“亨，小利有攸往”、六爻含義，以及在品牌營銷、個人形象、感情美化與職場禮儀中的實際占卜指導。",
    "cardTitleEn": "Yilore Reading",
    "cardTitleZh": "易羅解讀",
    "guaCiEn": "Grace has success. In small matters it is favorable to undertake something.",
    "guaCiZh": "賁：亨。小利有攸往。",
    "imageCommentaryEn": "Fire at the foot of the mountain: the image of Grace. Thus does the superior person proceed when clearing up current affairs. But he dare not decide great controversies in this way.",
    "imageCommentaryZh": "山下有火，賁。君子以明庶政，無敢折獄。",
    "overviewEn": "Grace (Bi) is the twenty-second hexagram. The lower trigram is Li (Fire) and the upper is Gen (Mountain). Fire at the foot of a mountain — the flames illuminate the mountain with beauty and color. This is the image of Grace: the power of aesthetic form to enhance substance.\nThe judgment is nuanced: Grace 'has success,' but 'in small matters' only. Adornment and beautiful form can enhance everyday affairs but cannot substitute for substance in great matters. The Image warns the superior person to 'clarify current affairs' through grace but 'not decide great controversies' through beauty alone. This hexagram celebrates aesthetic beauty while honestly acknowledging its limits.",
    "overviewZh": "賁（bì）卦是易經六十四卦之第二十二卦。從卦象上看，上卦為艮代表山，下卦為離代表火。火在山下燃燒，照亮了山體，使草木山石顯得光彩奪目。這就是文飾、包裝與禮儀的由來。大象傳提到君子以明庶政，無敢折獄，教導我們要用明察的眼光去處理日常政務，但在關乎生死的重大判決（折獄）中，不可被表面的文飾所迷惑。這一卦的核心在於尋找質樸本質與華麗外表之間的平衡點，提醒我們在追求美好的同時，不可失去真實的核心。",
    "readingSectionsEn": [],
    "readingSectionsZh": [],
    "divinationEn": {
      "career": "In career, Grace favors attention to presentation, style, and aesthetic quality. Polish your proposals, refine your communication, and bring elegance to your work. This is effective for routine matters and relationship-building. But for major decisions, substance must lead and form must follow.",
      "love": "In love, Grace encourages beautiful gestures, romantic settings, and attention to aesthetic details that enrich the relationship. Plan that special evening, write that heartfelt letter, create beauty in your shared space. But remember the deeper lines: the most enduring love ultimately values sincerity over elegance.",
      "wealth": "Financially, Grace advises paying attention to presentation in business dealings, keeping clean and attractive records, and presenting yourself professionally. These 'small graces' make a real difference. But major financial decisions should be based on substance, not appearance.",
      "health": "Health-wise, Grace encourages aesthetic self-care: grooming, wardrobe, the environments you spend time in. These external graces contribute to inner wellbeing. But the deeper message is that genuine health comes from inner substance, not outer polish."
    },
    "divinationZh": {
      "career": "職場運勢呈上揚趨勢。如果你正在負責策劃、設計或文案相關工作，你的創意會得到極大的認可。現在是提升公司品牌形象、最佳化產品包裝或個人IP打造的絕佳時機。在人際交往中，注重禮儀和職場著裝能顯著提升你的說服力。只要確保內容與形式相符，你的影響力將像山下的火光一樣引人矚目。",
      "love": "感情生活充滿了儀式感。近期適合安排一些精緻的約會、贈送走心的禮物，或者一同參與文化藝術活動。單身者近期極易透過良好的外在形象吸引異性。戀愛中的人則應注意，美化生活雖好，但不可用謊言掩蓋矛盾。只有在互相包容、真誠對待的基礎上進行“文飾”，感情才能長久芬芳。",
      "wealth": "財運小吉。利於透過文化產品、設計方案或短期創意專案獲得報酬。消費上可能會因為追求高顏值、大品牌而有超額支出，需注意控制。投資理財方面，要警惕那些包裝得過於華麗的專案，看清底層的資產邏輯。在這個階段，賺點小錢（小利）是容易的，但大額投入需萬分謹慎。",
      "health": "由於離火在內，需注意由於過度勞神、熬夜導致的眼部疲勞或視力下降。近期適合透過瑜伽、藝術療愈等方式進行內心的“文飾”。心態的從容會自然反映在你的面色上。中醫認為賁主文飾，也對應皮膚的健康。保持清淡飲食，適度補充水分，能讓你神采奕奕。此外，需防範心火過旺導致的口舌生瘡。"
    },
