        "titleZh": "賁如濡如，永貞吉。",
        "yaoTextEn": "Nine in the Third: Graceful and moist. Constant perseverance brings good fortune.",
        "yaoTextZh": "九三：賁如濡如，永貞吉",
        "summaryEn": "Grace that is rich, lustrous, and deeply satisfying — like a surface made luminous by moisture. This is adornment in its most beautiful form. But the warning: do not become intoxicated by beauty. Only perseverance in what is genuine brings lasting good fortune.",
        "summaryZh": "裝飾得潤澤光亮。九三處於全卦陽氣最盛處，極易沉溺於華麗。此時必須時刻保持警惕，堅守正道（永貞），不被外表的安逸所迷惑，才能獲得長久的吉祥。",
        "tuanEn": "The Tuan says: Grace — success. The yielding comes and adorns the strong; hence success. The strong above is divided and adorns the yielding; hence small matters are favored.",
        "tuanZh": "彖曰：賁，亨。柔來而文剛，故亨。分剛上而文柔，故小利有攸往。天文也。文明以止，人文也。觀乎天文，以察時變；觀乎人文，以化成天下。",
        "imageEn": "",
