        "positionLabelZh": "六四",
        "titleEn": "Grace or Simplicity? — The White Horse Comes Flying",
        "titleZh": "賁如皤如，白馬翰如。匪寇，婚媾。",
        "yaoTextEn": "Six in the Fourth: Grace or simplicity? A white horse comes as if on wings. He is not a robber, he will woo at the right time.",
        "yaoTextZh": "六四：賁如皤如，白馬翰如，匪寇婚媾",
        "summaryEn": "A moment of choice: elaborate adornment or honest simplicity? The white horse arrives — a suitor comes not with gifts but with pure sincerity. Choose substance over show, and the relationship that follows will be genuine.",
        "summaryZh": "裝飾得潔白素淨，騎著白色的駿馬疾馳。這是一種返璞歸真的美。遠方來的不是搶劫的敵人，而是求婚的盟友。暗示在真誠與質樸中，會迎來意外的好合與合作。",
