        "yaoTextEn": "Six in the Second: Quiet return. Good fortune.",
        "yaoTextZh": "六二：休復，吉",
        "summaryEn": "A gentle, humble return — following the example of good people nearby. This is the beautiful return: not dramatic or showy, but quietly, humbly coming back to the right path through the influence of worthy companions.",
        "summaryZh": "優美而順適地迴歸。六二緊鄰初九，能夠順從於正確的趨勢，放下偏見主動回頭。這是一種明智的跟隨，自然會獲得吉祥的結果。",
        "tuanEn": "The Tuan says: Return — success. The strong returns. Movement in devotion. Going out and coming in without error: the way of heaven.",
        "tuanZh": "彖曰：復亨，剛反。動而以順行，是以出入無疾，朋來無咎。反覆其道，七日來複，天行也。利有攸往，剛長也。復其見天地之心乎。",
        "imageEn": "",
