    "hexagramNumber": 25,
    "slug": "wuwanggua25",
    "nameEn": "Innocence",
    "nameZh": "天雷無妄卦",
    "fullTitleEn": "Hexagram 25 Innocence Explained: Spontaneity, Natural Action & Trusting the Way | I Ching",
    "fullTitleZh": "天雷無妄卦詳解：順應天時、赤誠無妄與現代運勢全解析 | 易經第二十五卦",
    "subtitleEn": "I Ching Hexagram 25 Innocence (Wu Wang) explained. Thunder under heaven — acting with natural spontaneity and without ulterior motive. Analysis of judgment, lines, and guidance for trusting natural timing.",
    "subtitleZh": "易經第二十五卦天雷無妄詳解。無妄卦象徵天下雷行、至誠無偽，代表真實、順應規律與防範意外。全面解析無妄卦卦辭“元亨利貞，其匪正有眚”、六爻含義，以及在事業守正、感情坦誠、財富積累與意外防範中的實際占卜指導。",
    "cardTitleEn": "Yilore Reading",
    "cardTitleZh": "易羅解讀",
    "guaCiEn": "Innocence. Sublime success. Perseverance furthers. If someone is not as he should be, he has misfortune, and it does not further him to undertake anything.",
    "guaCiZh": "無妄：元亨利貞。其匪正有眚，不利有攸往。",
    "imageCommentaryEn": "Under heaven, thunder rolls: all things attain the natural state of innocence. Thus the kings of old, rich in virtue and in harmony with the time, fostered and nourished all beings.",
    "imageCommentaryZh": "天下雷行，物與無妄。先王以茂對時，育萬物。",
    "overviewEn": "Innocence (Wu Wang) is the twenty-fifth hexagram. The lower trigram is Zhen (Thunder) and the upper is Qian (Heaven). Thunder moves beneath heaven — the creative force expressing itself through spontaneous, natural movement. 'Wu Wang' literally means 'without falseness' — acting in complete alignment with one's true nature, free from calculation or ulterior motive.\nThe judgment promises 'sublime success' for those who act with genuine innocence but warns: 'If someone is not as he should be, he has misfortune.' Innocence must be genuine — performed innocence is just another form of calculation. The Image shows the ancient kings 'in harmony with the time' — the essence of Innocence is alignment with natural timing and cosmic order, acting when conditions call for action and resting when they call for rest.",
    "overviewZh": "無妄（wú wàng）卦是易經六十四卦之第二十五卦。從卦象上看，上卦為乾代表天，下卦為震代表雷。雷行天下，萬物順應震動而生長，由於天道威嚴公正，萬物皆不敢存私心、弄虛假，此即無妄。無妄的核心含義是真實、不偽裝、不妄求。先王觀察此象，順應天時來養育萬物。這一卦深刻揭示了客觀規律與主觀態度之間的關係：唯有順應自然、保持內心的赤誠與純正，才能獲得真正的、長久的亨通。在充滿投機與焦慮的現代社會，無妄卦提醒我們迴歸那份最初的、成熟的天真。",
    "readingSectionsEn": [],
    "readingSectionsZh": [],
    "divinationEn": {
      "career": "In career, Innocence advises acting from genuine passion and authentic competence rather than political calculation. Do your work because it matters, not because of what it will get you. Paradoxically, this genuine, unmotivated excellence is the most effective career strategy of all.",
      "love": "In love, be completely yourself — no performance, no strategy, no pretense. The relationship that forms from genuine mutual recognition of true character is infinitely stronger than one built on careful impression management. Let love happen naturally rather than engineering it.",
      "wealth": "Financially, Innocence counsels against get-rich-quick schemes and calculated manipulations. Honest work, genuine value creation, and patient natural growth build lasting wealth. The farmer who follows the seasons prospers; the speculator who fights them eventually loses.",
      "health": "Health-wise, trust your body's natural wisdom. Eat when hungry, sleep when tired, move when energized. The most powerful health approach is alignment with your body's natural rhythms rather than forcing artificial regimens. Innocence in health means listening to your body's genuine signals."
    },
    "divinationZh": {
      "career": "職場運勢強調穩紮穩打。目前的你或許內心充滿了各種計劃與野心，甚至急於求成。無妄卦提示你，應當去除妄想，收斂那些不切實際的貪婪和投機心理。像專注的耕作者一樣，在現有的崗位上深耕。只要你做事坦誠、正直，不玩弄辦公室政治，你的價值會被天道（上級/行業）看在眼裡。任何不當的獲利嘗試近期都會引發嚴重的意外後果。",
      "love": "感情關係中，真實是唯一的入場券。如果你或者對方正在用套路、物質或謊言來粉飾太平，近期這些偽裝極易被揭穿。放下心理防線，展現最真實的自己。對於單身者，不要急於脫單而採取相親上的投機策略，保持你的本色和坦誠，那種純直的氣息反而能吸引到真正對的人。無妄之情，不問結果，反而能得善果。",
      "wealth": "財運平穩，但忌偏財。目前不宜參與任何形式的對賭、博彩或高槓杆投資。你的財富應來源於正當的勞動與合理的週期增值。無妄之災多發於貪婪之處，守住本金就是最好的理財。如果遇到莫名的財務糾紛（如六三爻），請透過法律和正當途徑解決，切勿嘗試私下解決或走捷徑。順天時而動的財氣最穩。",
      "health": "由於乾金與震木相剋，需防範神經痛、肝火旺盛或由於精神緊張導致的突發性小疾。遇到不適時，心態的放鬆（無妄）比藥物更重要。中醫認為，心無雜念則正氣存內。此外，無妄也代表意外，外出、駕車或進行戶外運動時，需特別遵守交通規則和安全流程，不要因為逞快或僥倖而遭遇無妄之傷。"
    },
