        "yaoTextEn": "Six in the Third: Undeserved misfortune. The cow that was tethered by someone is the wanderer's gain and the citizen's loss.",
        "yaoTextZh": "六三：無妄之災，或繫之牛，行人之得，邑人之災",
        "summaryEn": "Sometimes innocent people suffer undeserved misfortune — the tethered cow is taken by a passerby, and the townspeople are blamed for the theft. Bad things happen to good people. The lesson: even when you are innocent, external misfortune can strike. Don't add to the misfortune by blaming yourself.",
        "summaryZh": "無端遭受的意外之災。就像有人把牛拴在路邊，行人路過牽走了牛，而附近的村民卻被冤枉。提示我們近期可能會遭遇莫名的牽連或小人的轉嫁，需保持內心正直，靜待真相大白。",
