    "imageCommentaryEn": "The lake rises above the trees: The image of Preponderance of the Great. Thus the superior person, when he stands alone, is unconcerned, and if he has to renounce the world, he is undaunted.",
    "imageCommentaryZh": "澤滅木，大過。君子以獨立不懼，遁世無悶。",
    "overviewEn": "Hexagram 28 is the twenty-eighth hexagram of the I Ching, with the upper trigram Dui (Lake) and the lower trigram Xun (Wind/Wood). The lake rises above the trees — an extraordinary situation where water overwhelms the wood that should contain it. The four strong yang lines in the center bear down on the weak yin lines at top and bottom, like a ridgepole (the central beam of a roof) bearing too much weight, sagging to the breaking point.\nThis is the hexagram of extraordinary times requiring extraordinary measures. The \"Preponderance of the Great\" means that the great (yang) dominates excessively — the situation is out of normal balance. The ridgepole sags not because it is weak, but because the burden is extraordinary. What is needed is decisive action: \"It furthers one to have somewhere to go\" — one must move, act, or make a significant change before the structure collapses.\nThe Judgment tells us: the situation cannot hold as it is. But this is not cause for despair — it is a call for courageous action. Success comes to those who recognize the critical nature of the moment and respond with boldness.\nThe Image reveals the inner attitude needed: the superior person stands alone without concern and renounces the world without fear. In times of extraordinary pressure, conventional support structures may fail. One must be prepared to act independently and, if necessary, to sacrifice comfort for principle.",
    "overviewZh": "大過（dà guò）卦是易經六十四卦之第二十八卦。從卦象上看，上卦為兌代表澤，下卦為巽代表木。水沒過了樹木，象徵著某種狀態已經超出了常態，進入了極端、危險的領域。大過卦的主旨在於“大者過度”，即主樑由於負荷過重而彎曲不穩。這是一種臨界狀態，要麼徹底崩塌，要麼大破大立。卦辭“利有攸往”賦予了這種變局積極的意義：在極端壓力面前，坐以待斃絕無生路，唯有果斷採取非凡的行動，才有一線生機。大象傳教導君子要“獨立不懼”，在眾人都惶恐不安時，依然能堅守獨立判斷，勇於承擔責任。",
    "readingSectionsEn": [],
    "readingSectionsZh": [],
    "divinationEn": {
      "career": "Your career is under extraordinary pressure. The status quo is unsustainable — a major change, bold decision, or significant pivot is needed. Do not wait for collapse; act proactively. This may mean leaving an untenable position, taking on a challenging project, or making a decisive career shift. Extraordinary times call for extraordinary measures.",
      "love": "Relationships are under unusual strain. The normal dynamics have shifted, and the balance may feel precarious. This is not a time for half-measures — significant conversations, honest admissions, or bold gestures may be needed to prevent collapse. If a relationship is fundamentally sound, extraordinary effort can save it. If not, it may be time to acknowledge what cannot be sustained.",
      "wealth": "Financial matters are at a critical juncture. The current approach is unsustainable, and decisive financial restructuring or bold investment decisions may be necessary. This is not a time for timidity — but neither for recklessness. Calculate your risks carefully, then act with conviction. Extraordinary financial pressure can lead to extraordinary breakthroughs if channeled correctly.",
      "health": "Health may be under unusual strain. The body is signaling that the current pace or lifestyle is unsustainable. Take these signals seriously — extraordinary measures for rest, recovery, or medical attention may be needed. Do not push through warning signs. Address health issues with the same urgency that the hexagram demands in all areas."
    },
    "divinationZh": {
      "career": "職場壓力已達到爆發邊緣。你可能正負責一個難度極高的專案，或者處於公司變革的風口浪尖，感到孤立無援。現在的策略絕非順從或強撐，而是要有“大破大立”的決斷。敢於打破現有的條條框框，提出甚至實施那些驚世駭俗的方案。雖然這需要你承擔巨大的個人風險，但大過卦的生機正藏在這些非凡的行動之中。守住你的底線，獨立不懼地前行。",
      "love": "感情生活帶給你一種沉重的負疚感或壓力。你們的關係可能已經失衡，就像過重的房梁面臨折斷。如果雙方都在強行支撐，結果堪憂。此時需要深度的、推倒重來的溝通。如果是一段非傳統的戀情（如年齡差異巨大等），大過卦則提示這種關係需要極其強大的抗壓能力。只有當你們能做到“遁世無悶”，不在乎外界評價時，這段特殊感情才有存續的可能。",
      "wealth": "財運處於極度不穩的階段。你可能揹負著沉重的債務，或者投資組合極度向高風險傾斜，處於“虧損臨界點”。千萬不要再增加新的槓桿，否則“棟橈”之災就在眼前。如果你必須參與高收益專案，務必確保你的核心根基（資源/支援）不是薄弱的。這是一個利於“重組”和“清算”的時期，清掉那些拖累你的沉重資產，比盲目追求增長更重要。",
      "health": "身體狀況正處於過載狀態。兌澤與巽木相見，需特別注意防範由於長期焦慮、重壓導致的神經衰弱、失眠或肺部系統的問題（木受金克）。你會感到胸悶、氣喘或精力透支。請務必強制自己停下來，哪怕只有片刻。尋找一種像“白茅墊地”般的溫和調理方式。不要等到身體這根“大梁”徹底折斷才去後悔。呼吸練習和深度的獨處是你最好的止損藥方。"
    },
