    "subtitleZh": "易經第三十一卦澤山鹹詳解。鹹卦象徵感應、吸引與和諧，代表無心的默契與深層的共鳴。全面解析鹹卦卦辭“亨，利貞，取女吉”、六爻含義，以及在戀愛關係、靈感湧現、人際吸引與市場公關中的實際占卜指導。",
    "cardTitleEn": "Yilore Reading",
    "cardTitleZh": "易羅解讀",
    "guaCiEn": "Influence. Success. Perseverance furthers. To take a maiden to wife brings good fortune.",
    "guaCiZh": "鹹：亨，利貞，取女吉。",
    "imageCommentaryEn": "A lake on the mountain: The image of Influence. Thus the superior person encourages people to approach him by his readiness to receive them.",
    "imageCommentaryZh": "山上有澤，鹹。君子以虛受人。",
    "overviewEn": "Hexagram 31 is the thirty-first hexagram of the I Ching, with the upper trigram Dui (Lake) and the lower trigram Gen (Mountain). A lake resting upon the mountain — water above, stillness below — creates a powerful image of mutual attraction and influence. The lake's moisture nourishes the mountain; the mountain supports the lake. Neither forces the other; both give and receive naturally.\nThis is the first hexagram of the Lower Canon (hexagrams 31-64), which concerns human relationships. Fittingly, it begins with Influence — the magnetic attraction that draws people together. The Chinese character \"Xian\" means both \"to influence\" and \"all\" or \"universal,\" suggesting that true influence is not manipulation but a natural, mutual resonance.\nThe Judgment: Success. Perseverance furthers. To take a maiden to wife brings good fortune. The image of courtship represents the purest form of influence: attraction without coercion, drawing near through genuine appeal. The man (mountain) holds still and remains firm below; the woman (lake) is joyous and receptive above. Each is true to their nature, and from this authenticity, mutual attraction naturally arises.\nThe Image: A lake on the mountain. The superior person encourages approach through receptivity — not by pursuing or demanding, but by being genuinely open and welcoming. True influence is magnetic, not forceful.",
    "overviewZh": "鹹（xián）卦是下經之首，開啟了易經探討人際與萬物感應的新篇章。從卦象上看，上卦為兌代表澤（少女），下卦為艮代表山（少男）。山承載著澤，澤潤澤著山，山澤之氣相互感通。鹹即是“感”，它的核心在於那種跨越隔閡的吸引力。大象傳提到君子以虛受人，教導我們要像山谷接納湖水一樣，保持虛心的狀態去接納外界的人和事。唯有空靈之心，才能產生最敏銳、最真實的感應。這是一個強調同頻共振、和諧共處與精神共鳴的極佳卦象。",
    "readingSectionsEn": [],
    "readingSectionsZh": [],
    "divinationEn": {
      "career": "Influence in career matters speaks of natural professional magnetism. This is a time when your genuine qualities can attract opportunities, partnerships, and recognition. Do not force connections or push for results — let your work and character speak for themselves. Be receptive to new collaborations. The 'maiden' of career fortune comes to those who are authentically excellent rather than aggressively self-promoting.",
      "love": "This is one of the I Ching's most auspicious hexagrams for love and romance. Natural attraction is at work — genuine mutual influence rather than one-sided pursuit. If single, this is an excellent time for meeting someone significant through natural affinity. If in a relationship, deepen the connection through receptivity and authentic self-expression. 'To take a maiden to wife brings good fortune' — commitments made under this influence are blessed.",
      "wealth": "Financially, Influence suggests that wealth flows toward genuine value. Create real value and financial attraction follows naturally. This is not the time for aggressive financial maneuvering but for building genuine worth that naturally attracts prosperity. Investments in relationships and reputation pay dividends under this hexagram.",
      "health": "For health, Influence highlights the body-mind connection. Emotional states directly affect physical well-being, and physical sensations carry emotional information. Pay attention to what your body is telling you. Practices that harmonize body and mind — yoga, meditation, tai chi, mindful movement — are especially beneficial. The hexagram's progression through the body reminds us that wellness is a whole-body experience."
    },
    "divinationZh": {
      "career": "在事業上，現在是你建立關係網、尋求戰略聯盟的黃金時期。你的提案和觀點非常容易引起他人的共鳴。如果你是團隊領導，利用這種感應力去統一團隊計程車氣，效果會遠勝於行政命令。如果你正在尋找合作伙伴，憑直覺去選擇那些讓你感到“舒服”和“默契”的人選。這是一個利於公關、銷售、談判以及藝術創作的時期。保持真誠，共鳴即是生產力。",
      "love": "感情方面屬於大吉之兆。鹹卦代表最純粹的感應，你們之間正處於一種不需要多解釋就能心領神會的默契狀態。單身者近期極易遇到“一眼萬年”的正緣，建議主動敞開心扉。正在戀愛中的人，這是一個商討訂婚或結婚（取女吉）的最佳時機。這種基於心靈共鳴的關係不僅穩定，而且充滿了靈性的喜悅。享受這份無心的吸引力吧。",
      "wealth": "財運回暖，且多來源於人際感應。你可能會因為某個突如其來的靈感捕捉到商機，或者因為朋友、合夥人的感應推薦而獲得收益。在投資理財方面，鹹卦建議你不僅要看資料，也要關注市場的“情緒感應”。如果你經營企業，注重客戶的情感體驗和品牌共鳴，能帶來長期的利潤回報。保持誠信，讓利於人，財富會因感應而自然匯聚。",
      "health": "身體狀況良好，感官敏銳。鹹卦代表身體的感應系統，中醫認為近期適合進行一些身體觸碰或律動類的療愈，如SPA、舞蹈或輕柔的拉伸，這能有效緩解內心的壓力。需注意下肢關節以及肺部、呼吸道的保養（兌金受感）。更重要的是，保持情緒的通達。多接觸大自然，呼吸新鮮空氣，讓身心處於一種“虛受”的狀態，能量會自然充盈。"
    },
