    "subtitleZh": "易經第三十二卦雷風恆詳解。恆卦象徵雷動風隨、恆久不變，代表穩定、堅持與白頭偕老。全面解析恆卦卦辭“亨，無咎，利貞，利有攸往”、六爻含義，以及在事業深耕、婚姻忠誠、長期投資與生活準則中的實際占卜指導。",
    "cardTitleEn": "Yilore Reading",
    "cardTitleZh": "易羅解讀",
    "guaCiEn": "Duration: Success. No blame. Perseverance furthers. It furthers one to have somewhere to go.",
    "guaCiZh": "恆：亨，無咎，利貞，利有攸往。",
    "imageCommentaryEn": "Thunder and wind: the image of Duration. Thus the superior person stands firm and does not change his direction.",
    "imageCommentaryZh": "雷動風散，恆。君子以立不易方。",
    "overviewEn": "Hexagram 32, Duration (Heng), is the thirty-second of the sixty-four hexagrams of the I Ching. The upper trigram is Zhen (Thunder) and the lower trigram is Xun (Wind). Thunder stirs and wind follows — wind rises and thunder rolls — this is the eternal, symbiotic pattern of nature. The core of Duration lies in 'endurance' — finding the unchanging kernel within an ever-changing world. The Image Commentary tells us the superior person stands firm and does not change direction, teaching us to establish our life's direction and moral principles without drifting with the current. It emphasizes an attitude of unwavering commitment, believing that only sustained effort and faithful relationships can bear the full weight of a meaningful life. In today's fast-changing workplace and life, Duration offers a supreme guide to the power of constancy.",
    "overviewZh": "恆（héng）卦是易經第六十四卦之第三十二卦。上卦為震代表雷，下卦為巽代表風。雷動風隨，風起雷鳴，這是自然界永恆的伴生規律。恆卦的核心在於“久”，即在變動不居的世界中尋找那個不變的核心。大象傳提到君子以立不易方，教導我們要確立自己的人生方向和道德準則，不隨波逐流。它強調的是一種堅韌不拔的生命態度，認為只有持久的努力和忠誠的關係，才能承載起人生的厚度。在瞬息萬變的現代職場與生活中，恆卦提供了一份關於定力的頂級指引。",
