      "love": "Your emotional relationship is in a very healthy and stable state. Both partners demonstrate exceptional loyalty and responsibility. If you are single with a long-time close friend, this may soon blossom into a stable partnership. Those in love are well-positioned to discuss marriage and establish a long-term commitment. For married couples, the family atmosphere is harmonious and loving. Remember, the best love is not a momentary firework but the quiet companionship beneath an ancient tree — simplicity and constancy are what is truly real.",
      "wealth": "Financial fortune is smooth but not suited to speculative windfalls. Current wealth growth relies mainly on stable income and long-term financial planning. Highly favorable for dollar-cost averaging, insurance, real estate, and other long-term asset allocation. Reject any temptation of 'overnight riches' — volatile speculation is antithetical to the spirit of Duration. Hold to your financial principles and accumulate steadily — compound interest over time will yield astonishing returns.",
      "health": "Health is stable, but the key lies in 'regularity.' The combination of Thunder and Wind suggests paying attention to liver and gallbladder system stress caused by emotional fluctuations or irregular habits. Maintain regular meals, consistent exercise, and fixed sleep patterns. In traditional Chinese medicine, regularity promotes smooth energy flow. This is an excellent time for long-term physical training such as swimming, distance running, or tai chi. Avoid extreme dieting or intense exercise — gentle and sustained wellness practices suit you best right now."
