        "position": 1,
        "positionLabelEn": "First Six",
        "positionLabelZh": "第1爻",
        "titleEn": "Seeking Depth Too Soon — Persistence Brings Misfortune",
        "titleZh": "恆卦初六爻詳解",
        "yaoTextEn": "First Six: Seeking depth in what is enduring. Perseverance brings misfortune. Nothing that would further.",
        "yaoTextZh": "初六：浚恆，貞兇，無攸利",
        "summaryEn": "Digging too deep at the start. This line represents demanding absolute permanence or deep results when things have barely begun — too hasty, which leads to misfortune. It reminds us that everything has a process; nothing can be forced to completion overnight.",
        "summaryZh": "初六：浚恆，貞兇，無攸利。恆卦初六爻警告不要在開始階段就要求太深——操之過急只會適得其反。",
        "tuanEn": "The Tuan Commentary says: Duration means 'lasting.' The firm above and the yielding below; thunder and wind work together; the yielding and the active both respond — this is Duration. Duration brings success, no blame, and perseverance furthers because it endures in its proper way. The way of heaven and earth endures without ceasing. 'It furthers one to have somewhere to go' — when one end is reached, a new beginning follows. The sun and moon, following heaven, can shine forever; the four seasons change yet can endure in their cycle; the sage endures in his way and all under heaven is transformed. Observe what endures, and the nature of heaven, earth, and all things can be seen.",
        "tuanZh": "彖曰：恆，久也。剛上而柔下，雷風相與，巽而動，剛柔皆應，恆。恆亨無咎利貞，久於其道也。天地之道，恆久而不已也。利有攸往，終則有始也。日月得天而能久照，四時變化而能久成，聖人久於其道而天下化成。觀其所恆，而天地萬物之情可見矣。",
        "imageEn": "",
        "imageZh": "",
        "divinationEn": {
          "Career": "The First Six line is a stern warning against 'rushing for results' in career matters. If you've just entered a new environment and want to make sweeping reforms, or just taken over a project and want to deliver astonishing results — pause. 'Seeking depth in what is enduring brings misfortune' — pursuing depth when the foundation is unstable will only end badly. Take time first to understand the environment, build trust, and solidify the foundation. Like digging a foundation — dig a little first, reinforce it, then gradually go deeper.",
          "Relationships": "In matters of the heart, the First Six is the most direct 'don't rush' warning. Perhaps you've just met someone and call them twenty times a day, or just started dating and already discuss marriage and children, or just made things official and want to merge every aspect of your lives. 'Seeking depth in what is enduring' — you're digging on day one to the depth meant for day one hundred. This will make the other person feel suffocated and pressured. Good love needs time to mature — like fine wine that develops richness naturally. Forcing the process only produces a sour, bitter juice.",
          "Wealth": "For finances, the First Six warns against chasing high returns from the very start of investing. You might be tempted to put everything into a high-risk venture, hoping for quick multiplication. But without sufficient market understanding or a risk management system in place, this is building a tower on quicksand. Start with small amounts to test the waters, accumulate experience, develop market intuition — then gradually increase your investment.",
          "Health": "For health, the First Six warns 'beginners, don't go too hard.' If you've just started exercising and immediately do two hours of intense training daily, or just begun dieting and fast for three days — your body will break down. Healthy change requires the body to adapt gradually — walk twenty minutes the first week, thirty minutes the second week, adjust your diet structure in the first month — only gradual progress leads to truly lasting results."
        },
        "divinationZh": {
          "事業運勢": "初六爻在事業方面是對「急於求成」的嚴厲警告。如果你剛進入一個新環境就想大刀闊斧地改革、剛接手一個專案就想交出驚人的成績——停一停。「浚恆，貞兇」——在根基不穩的時候追求深度，結果一定是糟糕的。先花時間瞭解環境、建立信任、夯實基礎。像挖地基一樣——先挖淺一點、先加固、再逐步加深。",
          "感情運勢": "感情方面，初六爻是最直接的「別太急」警告。也許你剛認識一個人就每天打二十個電話、剛開始約會就聊到了結婚生子、剛確認關係就想把彼此的一切都融合在一起。「浚恆」——你在感情的第一天就挖到了第一百天才該挖的深度。這會讓對方感到窒息和壓力。好的感情需要像釀酒一樣——時間夠了自然醇厚。強行加速只會得到一杯酸澀的汁水。",
          "財運分析": "財運方面，初六爻警告你不要在投資初期就追求高回報。「浚恆」——你可能一上來就把全部身家押進一個高風險的專案，期望快速翻倍。但在你還沒有充分了解市場、沒有建立風險管理體系的時候——這樣做無異於在流沙上建樓。先用小額試水、積累經驗、建立對市場的感覺——然後再逐步加大投入。",
          "健康提示": "健康方面，初六爻提醒「新手勿重訓」。如果你剛開始健身就每天兩小時高強度訓練、剛開始節食就斷食三天——「浚恆，貞兇」——身體會崩潰的。健康的改變需要身體慢慢適應——第一週每天走二十分鐘、第二週加到三十分鐘、第一個月先調整飲食結構——循序漸進才能真正持久。"
        },
        "cardUrlLocal": "/yilore-cards/yao_all/32-1a.webp",
        "cardUrlRemoteEn": "https://karapfmpojnzolxlmsxv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/yilore_cards/32/32-1a-en.webp",
