        "titleZh": "恆卦上六爻詳解",
        "yaoTextEn": "Six at the Top: Restlessness in duration brings misfortune.",
        "yaoTextZh": "上六：振恆，兇",
        "summaryEn": "Wavering persistence. At the very end of Duration, one becomes agitated and restless, losing fundamental composure. This kind of anxious, unsettled 'persistence' inevitably brings misfortune. It admonishes us to finish well and maintain inner peace.",
        "summaryZh": "上六：振恆，兇。恆卦上六爻警告穩定到極點後的無目的躁動——如同火山爆發般毀滅性的失控。",
        "tuanEn": "The Tuan Commentary says: Duration means 'lasting.' The firm above and the yielding below; thunder and wind work together; the yielding and the active both respond — this is Duration. Duration brings success, no blame, and perseverance furthers because it endures in its proper way.",
        "tuanZh": "彖曰：恆，久也。剛上而柔下，雷風相與，巽而動，剛柔皆應，恆。恆亨無咎利貞，久於其道也。",
        "imageEn": "",
