    "nameZh": "天山遁卦",
    "fullTitleEn": "Hexagram 33 — Retreat: Strategic Withdrawal and Self-Preservation",
    "fullTitleZh": "天山遁卦詳解：智者退避、白鹿入林與現代運勢全解析 | 易經第三十三卦",
    "subtitleEn": "Hexagram 33 Retreat explained: Heaven over Mountain symbolizes strategic withdrawal. Explore the hexagram text, all six lines, and guidance for career, love, wealth, and health.",
    "subtitleZh": "易經第三十三卦天山遁詳解。遁卦象徵天下有山、陰氣漸長，代表退避、隱匿與保全實力。全面解析遁卦卦辭“亨，小利貞”、六爻含義，以及在逆境止損、事業緩步、感情距離感與複雜人際處理中的實際占卜指導。",
    "cardTitleEn": "Yilore Reading",
    "cardTitleZh": "易羅解讀",
    "guaCiEn": "Retreat: Success. In small matters perseverance furthers.",
    "guaCiZh": "遁：亨。小利貞。",
    "imageCommentaryEn": "Heaven under which there is a mountain: the image of Retreat. Thus the superior person keeps the inferior at a distance, not with hatred but with dignity.",
    "imageCommentaryZh": "天下有山，遁。君子以遠小人，不惡而嚴。",
    "overviewEn": "Hexagram 33, Retreat (Dun), is the thirty-third of the sixty-four hexagrams. The upper trigram is Qian (Heaven) and the lower trigram is Gen (Mountain). Heaven is above the mountain, yet the mountain's height cannot reach heaven — symbolizing a lofty withdrawal and separation. The core logic of Retreat lies in 'avoidance.' When yin forces gradually grow, yang forces must proactively pull back to preserve the vital flame. The Image Commentary states that the superior person keeps the inferior at a distance, not with hatred but with dignity — teaching us that when dealing with negative energy or opposing forces, we need not resort to harsh words but can protect ourselves through maintaining distance and firmly guarding our boundaries. This is strategic wisdom, recognizing that taking one step back is not merely yielding ground but creating space for a future leap to even greater heights. In today's fiercely competitive environment of severe internal friction, Retreat is a sobering remedy for cutting losses.",
    "overviewZh": "遁（dùn）卦是易經第六十四卦之第三十三卦。上卦為乾代表天，下卦為艮代表山。天在山之上，且山之高遠無法觸及天，象徵著一種高遠的隱匿與隔離。遁卦的核心邏輯在於“避”。當陰氣逐漸增長，陽氣必須主動後撤以保全火種。大象傳提到君子以遠小人，不惡而嚴，教導我們與那些負能量或對立勢力相處時，不需要惡言相向，而是透過保持距離、嚴守底線來保護自己。這是一種戰略性的智慧，認為退一步不僅是海闊天空，更是為了未來更高層級的躍升。在競爭慘烈、內耗嚴重的現實環境中，遁卦是一劑清醒的止損良藥。",
    "readingSectionsEn": [],
    "readingSectionsZh": [],
    "divinationEn": {
      "career": "The workplace environment may be turning oppressive or filled with unhealthy competition. Forcing yourself to stand out or fight for control will make you a target. Adopt a low-profile strategy: voluntarily distance yourself from the core of power struggles, even considering a leave of absence or further education. This isn't giving up but 'retreating without chaos.' Use this time to repair gaps and preserve core resources. Remember, the white deer enters the forest not out of cowardice but to grow more safely in the deep woods.",
      "love": "A degree of opposition or fatigue has appeared in the relationship. If current communication is charged with hostility, then 'retreat' is the best loss-cutting strategy. Don't try to resolve issues through arguments; appropriate solitude or even temporary separation can help both sides reassess the relationship's value. Give each other some distance and use time and space to heal current sharp conflicts. This isn't coldness — it's wisdom.",
      "wealth": "Financial fortune is trending downward with hidden risks accumulating. Investment-wise, it's favorable to 'close positions' or 'reduce holdings,' especially projects where you feel overwhelmed. Don't believe in bottom-fishing — the actual bottom may still be lower. Reduce spending and ensure absolute cash flow safety. Retreat advises: when you can't make money, the most important thing is not losing money. Guard what you have and wait for better timing.",
      "health": "Your body may be showing sub-health warnings from prolonged tension. The interaction of Heaven (metal) and Mountain (earth) energy suggests watching for digestive issues or minor respiratory problems caused by mental stress. The most effective wellness approach is 'hermitage' — disconnect from the internet, social obligations; go to the mountains or forest and breathe deeply. Through connecting with nature, restore your body's natural healing capacity. This is the period to slow down and deeply nourish yourself."
    },
    "divinationZh": {
      "career": "職場環境可能正變得壓抑或充滿了不健康的競爭。此時強行表現或爭奪控制權會讓你成為眾矢之的。建議採取低調應對的策略，主動遠離利益紛爭的核心，甚至可以考慮休假或進修。這不代表放棄，而是“遁而不亂”。利用這段時間查漏補缺，保全核心資源。記住，白鹿入林不是因為膽怯，而是為了在深林中更安全地成長。",
      "love": "感情關係中出現了某種程度的對立或疲勞。如果當下的溝通充滿了火藥味，那麼“退避”就是最好的止損方案。不要試圖透過爭吵來解決問題，適當的獨處或分居反而能讓雙方重新審視這段關係的價值。給彼此一點距離感，用時間和空間去沖淡負面情緒。守住內心的平靜，不要在亂局中做出衝動的情感決定。",
      "wealth": "財運呈下行態勢，風險正在暗中累積。投資方面利於“清倉”或“減倉”，尤其是那些你已經感到力不從心的專案。不要迷信抄底，目前的底部可能還在下方。在消費上要收縮規模，確保現金流的絕對安全。遁卦提示：賺不到錢不重要，重要的是不虧損。保持財務的隱匿和清淨，能讓你避開後續可能出現的重大財務風險。",
      "health": "身體狀況可能因為長期的緊繃而出現亞健康警告。由於乾金與艮土的相互作用，需注意由於精神壓力引起的消化不良或呼吸系統的小毛病。最有效的養生方案是“隱居”——給自己斷網、斷社交、去山野或森林中深呼吸。透過大自然的負離子和靜謐的氛圍來修復受損的神經系統。保持內心的空明，這是遁卦給予你的最高健康啟示。"
    },
