        "yaoTextZh": "九二：貞吉",
        "summaryEn": "Steady, centered strength. Nine in the Second holds the middle way — powerful yet balanced, strong yet restrained. This is the ideal expression of great power: firm but not aggressive, confident but not arrogant. Simply holding to the right course brings good fortune.",
        "summaryZh": "九二：貞吉。大壯卦九二爻——陽剛居中，壯而守正，如田野中屹立不動的磐石。",
        "tuanEn": "The Tuan Commentary says: The Power of the Great — the great is powerful. The firm moves and is dynamic — hence The Power of the Great. 'The Power of the Great: Perseverance furthers' — the great one is in the correct position. The great correctness reveals the nature of heaven and earth.",
