        "position": 4,
        "positionLabelEn": "Nine in the Fourth",
        "positionLabelZh": "第4爻",
        "titleEn": "Perseverance Brings Good Fortune. The Fence Breaks Open — Power in the Great Wagon's Axle",
        "titleZh": "大壯卦九四爻詳解",
        "yaoTextEn": "Nine in the Fourth: Perseverance brings good fortune. Remorse disappears. The fence breaks open without entangling. Power is like the axle of a great wagon.",
        "yaoTextZh": "九四：貞吉，悔亡；藩決不羸，壯於大輿之輹",
        "summaryEn": "Obstacles give way, power flows freely. Like the axle of a great wagon that moves everything forward with irresistible momentum. Previous regrets vanish as your strength finds its proper channel. This is power at its most effective — breaking through by moving in the right direction.",
        "summaryZh": "九四：貞吉，悔亡；藩決不羸。大壯卦九四爻——籬笆終於被開啟，重車破關，困局化解。",
        "tuanEn": "The Tuan Commentary says: The Power of the Great — the great is powerful. The firm moves and is dynamic — hence The Power of the Great. 'The Power of the Great: Perseverance furthers' — the great one is in the correct position. The great correctness reveals the nature of heaven and earth.",
        "tuanZh": "彖曰：大壯，大者壯也。剛以動，故壯。大壯利貞，大者正也。正大而天地之情可見矣。",
