          "Relationships": "Emotional barriers are dissolving. If there were walls between you and your partner (or a potential partner), they are now giving way to your sustained, genuine effort. This is the moment of breakthrough — advance with warmth and honesty.",
          "Wealth": "Financial momentum is building and previous obstacles are clearing. Your investments are beginning to produce returns, deals are closing, and income is flowing. Maintain your steady approach — the great wagon is rolling forward.",
