        "answer": "Hexagram 34 is highly auspicious — it represents yang energy at its peak, vigorous strength, and great momentum. Four yang lines push upward with tremendous force. However, the hexagram's wisdom lies in its caution: great power must be tempered with righteousness. 'Perseverance furthers' means this power only leads to good outcomes when guided by proper principles. Unrestrained strength without ethical direction becomes recklessness."
