          "Career & Work": "In career matters, the fifth line is an extraordinary affirmation. Your professional integrity, competence, and sincerity are being recognized and rewarded. If you are in a leadership position, your authentic approach is inspiring trust and loyalty in your team. If you are working toward advancement, the fifth line confirms that your genuine efforts are visible to those who matter. Continue leading by example, maintaining your ethical standards, and treating colleagues with sincerity. The career success promised by this line is not based on politics or appearances but on real substance — which means it will be durable and deeply satisfying.",
